[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5050164215","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121649#issuecomment-5050164215","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121649","id":5050164215,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLQNj9w","user":{"login":"mattigu","id":47303532,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MzAzNTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47303532?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu","html_url":"https://github.com/mattigu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-22T18:52:12Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T18:52:12Z","body":"I'm pretty sure this is not an issue with godot, it's just how git works.\n```\n// Created empty project, git add --all, git commit -m \"init commit\"\n➜  git-test git:(master) ls\nicon.svg  icon.svg.import  project.godot\n➜  git-test git:(master) mkdir test_dir\n➜  git-test git:(master) mv icon.svg test_dir\n➜  git-test git:(master) ✗ git status\nOn branch master\nChanges not staged for commit:\n  (use \"git add/rm <file>...\" to update what will be committed)\n  (use \"git restore <file>...\" to discard changes in working directory)\n\tdeleted:    icon.svg\n\nUntracked files:\n  (use \"git add <file>...\" to include in what will be committed)\n\ttest_dir/\n\nno changes added to commit (use \"git add\" and/or \"git commit -a\")\n```\nNotice how `test_dir` is untracked, meaning the changes there won't be stashed. And `icon.svg` is detected as deleted.\nWhat stashing does is revert the deletion of `icon.svg`, meaning the icon actually is in both places. It's not godot that is wrong. See below.\n```\n➜  git-test git:(master) ✗ git stash\nSaved working directory and index state WIP on master: 93beeca init commit\n➜  git-test git:(master) ✗ ls\nicon.svg  icon.svg.import  project.godot  test_dir\n➜  git-test git:(master) ✗ ls test_dir\nicon.svg\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5050164215/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5050559890","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121649#issuecomment-5050559890","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121649","id":5050559890,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLQltkg","user":{"login":"HonestlyFranklySpeaking","id":213770735,"node_id":"U_kgDODL3h7w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213770735?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonestlyFranklySpeaking","html_url":"https://github.com/HonestlyFranklySpeaking","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonestlyFranklySpeaking/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonestlyFranklySpeaking/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonestlyFranklySpeaking/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonestlyFranklySpeaking/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonestlyFranklySpeaking/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonestlyFranklySpeaking/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonestlyFranklySpeaking/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonestlyFranklySpeaking/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonestlyFranklySpeaking/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-22T19:31:01Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T19:31:01Z","body":"Oh that makes sense, sorry for the mistake.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5050559890/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]